Text Mesa 26.2.1's vc4 driver writes with VC4_DEBUG for our tools/v3d/gl_ref.py
on the drm-shim (README.md). The values are those of our draw; the packet,
field and instruction names are Mesa's (MIT, NOTICE 1b).
